ntor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0286a59\" data-id=\"0286a59\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c36d99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c36d99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b><i>Technical Translation Expertise<\/i><\/b><\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97ddcc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"97ddcc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Many people think that technical translation refers to translation of different texts of scientific and technical nature, for example technical manuals, instructions, engineering reports, etc. But in fact, almost ANY specialized area of human activity, from knitting to farming, usually has unique terminology and jargon that outsiders will not know, resorting to gestures and words like \u2013 Well, take that thing and point it over there!, resulting in lack of precision, wasted time at best, and often even creating real danger to human life. \u00a0<\/p><p>Such texts are usually characterized by formal and logical style, unambiguousness, consistency and relative narrowness of language, as well as by frequent use of special terminology. Technical documents are incredibly important to business success because their translations should be accurate, precise and easily understandable by professionals, engineers, technicians, consumers in various countries and markets, and so on. This means that when undertaking a translation of a technical document, you need a specialist with technical background.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-27a5001 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"27a5001\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-596c540\" data-id=\"596c540\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfbc535 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"bfbc535\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"883\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/waldemar-brandt-rxw40ksjnbu-unsplash-3-scaled-e1663855936294-1024x883.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4447\" alt=\"windmill\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/waldemar-brandt-rxw40ksjnbu-unsplash-3-scaled-e1663855936294-1024x883.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/waldemar-brandt-rxw40ksjnbu-unsplash-3-scaled-e1663855936294-300x259.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/waldemar-brandt-rxw40ksjnbu-unsplash-3-scaled-e1663855936294-768x662.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/waldemar-brandt-rxw40ksjnbu-unsplash-3-scaled-e1663855936294-1536x1325.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/waldemar-brandt-rxw40ksjnbu-unsplash-3-scaled-e1663855936294-600x518.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/waldemar-brandt-rxw40ksjnbu-unsplash-3-scaled-e1663855936294.jpg 1572w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4dacae6\" data-id=\"4dacae6\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb73418 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bb73418\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>There are many different types of technical documents, and ABC Language Solutions has extensive experience in translating them in a professional way. Below are just some of them:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Manuals<\/li>\n<li>User guides<\/li>\n<li>Operating manuals<\/li>\n<li>Technical descriptions<\/li>\n<li>Technical reports<\/li>\n<li>Instructions<\/li>\n<li>Patents<\/li>\n<li>Scientific papers<\/li>\n<li>Safety Data Sheets<\/li>\n<li>Feasibility studies<\/li>\n<li>Engineering specifications<\/li>\n<li>Tender documents<\/li>\n<li>Parts lists, equipment catalogues and many others<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6006489 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6006489\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-80762e8\" data-id=\"80762e8\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elemento