in technical translations, who are ready to help you!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c383037 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c383037\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8b93ed4\" data-id=\"8b93ed4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eff6414 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"eff6414\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1834\" height=\"1241\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/janik-sbq90ov3a6e-unsplash-scaled-e1663857299127.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4449\" alt=\"Mining\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/janik-sbq90ov3a6e-unsplash-scaled-e1663857299127.jpg 1834w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/janik-sbq90ov3a6e-unsplash-scaled-e1663857299127-300x203.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/janik-sbq90ov3a6e-unsplash-scaled-e1663857299127-1024x693.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/janik-sbq90ov3a6e-unsplash-scaled-e1663857299127-768x520.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/janik-sbq90ov3a6e-unsplash-scaled-e1663857299127-1536x1039.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/janik-sbq90ov3a6e-unsplash-scaled-e16